&lt;div class=&#34;hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Optional: Open the &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:12121&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;agentregistry UI&lt;/a&gt; and go to the &lt;strong&gt;Prompts&lt;/strong&gt; view. Verify that you can see your prompt.

   
   
   
   
   
   
   
   
   
     
     
       
         
       
     
       
         
       
     
       
         
       
     
       
         
       
     
       
         
       
     
     
   
   
